      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m a bit sad that this isn\u0027t used consistently and we still have a lot of places where we only use phys_addr_t *. But maybe a deeper question, wouldn\u0027t it be simpler to just add a separate mc so we have a one for stage-2 pages, and one for vm metadata?",
