      "writtenOn": "2022-11-02T09:51:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I considered it, but thought it would be more changes in the teardown path, that flags might have a chance to be reused in the future and that it doesn\u0027t add anything to the kvm struct.\n\nNonetheless, I\u0027m happy to change for a separated MC.",
